<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bco/apqc-cap-desc> rdfs:comment "The description layer and the evidence register (specification v0.5 section 4; CD14, CD15, CD17): information content entity classes about organizations and their capabilities, and the two annotation properties bco:concernsType and bco:assessedPresence, written by tools/ontology/formalize.py from src/05_ontology/tranche-2-description.yaml. No class here is a capability type, and none asserts that any organization bears a capability." .

bco:AuthorizationRecord rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:AuthorizationRecord rdfs:label "Authorization Record"@en .
bco:AuthorizationRecord rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 .
bco:AuthorizationRecord skos:definition "A Descriptive ICE that is about an agent and records an authorization for that agent to perform acts of one act class during a stated period, citing the authority that issued it."@en .

bco:CapabilityAssessment rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:CapabilityAssessment rdfs:label "Capability Assessment"@en .
bco:CapabilityAssessment rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 .
bco:CapabilityAssessment skos:definition "A Descriptive ICE that describes an organization with respect to the presence, absence or partial presence of a capability of one given type, is about that capability where one is identified, states exactly one finding against identifiable criteria, and cites the evidence it rests on. An evaluation without a finding, criteria or evidence is not one (CD14)."@en .

bco:CapabilityMap rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:CapabilityMap rdfs:label "Capability Map"@en .
bco:CapabilityMap rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 .
bco:CapabilityMap skos:definition "A Descriptive ICE that describes an organization and has, as continuant parts, the Capability Assessments and Capability Targets that are its entries."@en .

bco:CapabilityMaturityRating rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:CapabilityMaturityRating rdfs:label "Capability Maturity Rating"@en .
bco:CapabilityMaturityRating rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00001010 .
bco:CapabilityMaturityRating skos:definition "An Ordinal Measurement ICE that ranks an existing Organization Capability instance on a specified ordinal scale, carrying its ordinal value and citing the assessment that produced it. The value's encoding is chosen at Stage 05 (R5-02)."@en .

bco:CapabilitySourcingAssessment rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:CapabilitySourcingAssessment rdfs:label "Capability Sourcing Assessment"@en .
bco:CapabilitySourcingAssessment rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 .
bco:CapabilitySourcingAssessment skos:definition "A Descriptive ICE that is about a Capability Sourcing Statement and describes the consumer's dependence on that arrangement on stated criteria and evidence: operational risk, possibility of substitution, and whether the consumer bears an internal capability for the sourced acts."@en .

bco:CapabilitySourcingStatement rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:CapabilitySourcingStatement rdfs:label "Capability Sourcing Statement"@en .
bco:CapabilitySourcingStatement rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 .
bco:CapabilitySourcingStatement skos:definition "A Descriptive ICE that describes an Organization's arrangement for obtaining performances of one specified Planned Act class from one other Organization."@en .

bco:CapabilityTarget rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:CapabilityTarget rdfs:label "Capability Target"@en .
bco:CapabilityTarget rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000476 .
bco:CapabilityTarget skos:definition "An Objective that prescribes that an organization come to bear a capability of one given type."@en .

bco:CapabilityTargetStateSpecification rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:CapabilityTargetStateSpecification rdfs:label "Capability Target-State Specification"@en .
bco:CapabilityTargetStateSpecification rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000974 .
bco:CapabilityTargetStateSpecification skos:definition "A Plan that prescribes the acts through which an organization is to reach one or more Capability Targets, such as recruitment, training, technology deployment or a sourcing arrangement, and has those targets as continuant parts."@en .

bco:FunctionalAdequacyAssessment rdf:type owl:Class .
bco:FunctionalAdequacyAssessment rdfs:label "Functional Adequacy Assessment"@en .
bco:FunctionalAdequacyAssessment rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 .
bco:FunctionalAdequacyAssessment skos:definition "A statement that describes one Organization with respect to one Standing Function, and states three findings, each met, partly met or not met against required criteria and established by cited evidence: integration and coordination, operational availability, and adequacy for the function."@en .

bco:assessedPresence rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty .
bco:assessedPresence rdfs:label "assessed presence"@en .
bco:assessedPresence skos:definition "Records the finding of every Capability Assessment (CD14)"@en .

bco:concernsType rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty .
bco:concernsType rdfs:label "concerns type"@en .
bco:concernsType skos:definition "Identifies the capability class or act class an ICE concerns (CD14)"@en .
